  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Solutions for the Decarbonization of Viet Nam#s Cement Industry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to catalyze the transformational change in the cement industry in Viet Nam by creating a business case for the shift to near-zero-emission production. The project will develop a suitable policy framework, sector decarbonization roadmap, company-specific plans, replicable financial mechanisms, implement projects based on the decarbonization plans, and capacity building activities and initiatives. The project interventions will have promoted GHG mitigation and significantly contributed to Viet Nam targets to reach net-zero emission by 2050, its NDC 2022 and Viet Nam#s NDC Partnership. The project will have promoted a climate-resilient and competitive cement industry, create green jobs, stimulated green investment, fostered the adoption of near-zero-emission technologies and innovation, technology and investment partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
